UnitNostrVerify::claimLinkEventId
└── when serializing a golden claim link event
    └── it matches the nostr-tools event id


UnitNostrVerify::npubHashFromPubkey
└── when hashing a pubkey with the NIP-19 npub prefix byte
    └── it matches the golden npub hash


UnitNostrVerify::verifyBinding
├── when the signature is valid
│   └── it verifies successfully
├── when the signature is invalid
│   └── it reverts
└── when the signature length is invalid
    └── it reverts


UnitNostrVerify::verify
└── when the encoded event is valid
    └── it returns the parsed binding
